{"type":"exercise","type_name":"Exercise","number":"","title":"C1: Exit check: the descent and the theorem","title_html":"C1: Exit check: the descent and the theorem","html":"<div class=\"enumerate\" data-options=\"label=(\\alph*)\">\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li>Prove <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"lem-complex-polynomial-descent\">@lem-complex-polynomial-descent</span>\nfrom <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"lem-complex-direction-negative-real-part\">@lem-complex-direction-negative-real-part</span>\nand <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-polynomial-taylor-shift\">@thm-polynomial-taylor-shift</span>.</li>\n<li>Deduce <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-fundamental-theorem-algebra\">@thm-fundamental-theorem-algebra</span>\nfrom (a) and <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-complex-polynomial-minimum\">@thm-complex-polynomial-minimum</span>.</li>\n<li>The field <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Q}(i)\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211A TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> of <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"exm-subfields-gaussian\">@exm-subfields-gaussian</span>\nsatisfies the field axioms, and <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" da